 "_specialtyDoc": "zones.<z>.specialtySites = the bake's own special water (stream T's zone.json `pools`: hot springs, acid pools, the crater lake) with the name the island calls each one. `specialties` lists what a later stream gives mechanics to (hot_spring: Steam-soaked; geyser; lava_vent; ashfall). Zones whose specialty has no baked site yet (Blackstrand's spring, every geyser and lava vent) wait on that stream.",
 "levels": {
  "_doc": "tools/content-place.mjs levelField: the island's level ramp. Torbor Downs ramps gently from its start hub (550 m a level, below a zone's band near the hub). Vharlen is small and its hardest zone (the Caldera) is in the middle, a short walk from the landing, so every zone keeps its own band floor and the ramp inside a zone is steeper.",
